      "q": "How much does Medline Industries make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Medline Industries has $806M in federal contract obligations for FY2026 to date. The company received 678 awards so far this fiscal year, the average award size is $1.2M, and obligations are up 39.2% year over year."
