      "q": "Which agencies buy from Medline Industries?",
      "a": "The Department of Veterans Affairs is the largest buyer, obligating $763M. Other buyers include the Department of Health and Human Services ($32M), the Department of Justice ($10M), the Department of the Treasury ($295K), the Department of the Interior ($109K), and the Department of Defense ($63.1K)."
